#: front-page.php:13
msgid "An AI chatbot that knows your website"
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:14
msgid "It reads your pages, posts and products, answers visitors in their own language, shows where each answer comes from, and turns interested visitors into leads. This website is a live demo: ask the chat anything about it."
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:17
msgid "Learns your website in one click"
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:17
msgid "It scans your published pages, posts, products and page builder content, and updates itself when you edit them."
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:18
msgid "Speaks your visitor's language"
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:18
msgid "A visitor can ask in English, Urdu, Arabic, Spanish or many other languages and get the answer in the same language."
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:19
msgid "Shows its sources"
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:19
msgid "Each answer can list the pages it came from, so visitors can read more and trust what they see."
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:20
msgid "Captures leads"
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:20
msgid "When a visitor is interested, the chat asks for their name, email and phone. Leads are saved on your own website and emailed to you."
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:21
msgid "Answers day and night"
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:21
msgid "Visitors get an answer at any hour, even when nobody is at the desk."
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:22
msgid "Matches your brand"
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:22
msgid "Set the colour, position, icon, avatar, welcome message and suggested questions, and see the result in a live preview."
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:23
msgid "Keeps a conversation log"
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:23
msgid "Analytics, the most asked questions and a list of questions it could not answer, so you can add the answer once."
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:24
msgid "Respects privacy"
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:24
msgid "Data stays in your WordPress database. Export and erase tools and automatic deletion of old conversations are built in."
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:25
msgid "Works on any WordPress site"
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:25
msgid "Works with Elementor. In WooCommerce shops it shows product cards with Add to cart and looks up order status."
msgstr ""

