#: front-page.php:37
msgid "Do I need to write the answers myself?"
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:37
msgid "No. The chatbot reads the content already on your website and answers from it. You can add instructions, such as the tone to use or topics to avoid."
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:38
msgid "What if it does not know the answer?"
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:38
msgid "It says so instead of making something up, and can offer to take the visitor's details so you can follow up."
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:39
msgid "Will it slow down my website?"
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:39
msgid "The chat loads after the page and only talks to the AI service when a visitor sends a message."
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:40
msgid "Can it use my logo and colours?"
msgstr ""

#: front-page.php:40
msgid "Yes. The colour, icon, avatar, name and messages can all be changed to match your brand."
msgstr ""

